{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8LoomCore13DatabaseActorC","text":"DatabaseActor","kind":"attribute","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/DatabaseActor"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"exec","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"raw","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"statement","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"binder","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": @","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8LoomCore13DatabaseActorC","text":"DatabaseActor","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/DatabaseActor"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"borrowing","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8LoomCore15StatementHandleV","text":"StatementHandle","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/StatementHandle"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Suitable for INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, DDL (CREATE\/DROP\/ALTER), PRAGMA, and any other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"non-SELECT statement. The statement is prepared, bound via the closure, then stepped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to completion. Suspends while a transaction owned by another task is active."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accepts exactly one statement — SQL containing a second one throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/LoomCoreErrorCode\/trailingSQL"},{"type":"text","text":". Use "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Database\/execScript(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for migration scripts."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["try await db.exec(","  raw: \"INSERT INTO users (name, age) VALUES (?, ?)\",","  binder: { stmt in","    try \"Alice\".bind(to: stmt, at: 1)","    try 25.bind(to: stmt, at: 2)","  }",")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Parameter indices in the binder are 1-based, matching SQLite’s convention."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Rows the statement produces ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RETURNING"},{"type":"text","text":", row-returning "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PRAGMA"},{"type":"text","text":"s) are stepped through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and discarded — use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"query"},{"type":"text","text":" family to read them."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Cancelling the task interrupts the statement mid-step and throws "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CancellationError"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"LoomCore does not inspect statements for transaction control. Running "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BEGIN"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"COMMIT"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"code":"END","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"ROLLBACK","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"SAVEPOINT","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RELEASE"},{"text":" here bypasses the transaction gate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Database\/Service","type":"reference"},{"text":" hooks, and is entirely at the caller’s own risk. See","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/TransactionsAndServices#Transaction-control-SQL-is-the-callers-responsibility","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"style":"warning","name":"Warning","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Executes a raw SQL statement with a custom parameter binder.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/loomcore\/database\/exec(raw:binder:)-83vkp"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Database\/exec(raw:binder:)-83vkp","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"exec"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"raw"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"binder"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"borrowing"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8LoomCore15StatementHandleV","text":"StatementHandle"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"externalID":"s:8LoomCore8DatabaseC4e